url: "http://atlas.brainsmatics.cn/PlaqueMap"

version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-17"
license: MIT

keywords:
  - amyloid-beta
  - plaque morphotype
  - plaque subtype
  - radiomics
  - fMOST
  - Alzheimer's disease
  - machine learning
  - whole mouse brain

abstract: >
  An end-to-end pipeline for quantitative characterization of amyloid-beta (A-beta) plaques.
  Module 1 extracts geometric, intensity and radiomics features from 2D and 3D plaque images;
  Module 2 classifies plaques into morphotypes (Diffuse / Core / CAA) and discovers subtypes
  by clustering; Module 3 provides standalone downstream analysis tools (feature similarity,
  post-processing, and distribution-difference testing).

